    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d601">

                <pb facs="0617" n="611" sameAs="frus:frus1894app1/pg611"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Sir Julian Pauncefote
                        to Mr. Gresham.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1894-01-04"><hi rendition="#italic">January 4,
                        1894</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: With reference to my note of the 12th
                    ultimo I have the honor, by direction of the Earl of Rosebery, to communicate to
                    you the inclosed copy of a dispatch from Her Majesty’s consul at Apia to his
                    lordship, reporting on the collection of native taxes and the financial
                    arrangements made by the consular board.</p>
                <p>I have, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Julian
                    Pauncefote.</hi></signed></closer>



                <xi:include href="d601-a1.xml" xpointer="d601-a1"/>
